From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp90: Implement the messages facet.

Fast mode for msvcp60 .. msvcp90: the messages facet was all spec stubs
(and its id and vtable exports commented out). messages<char>,
messages<wchar_t> and messages<unsigned short> with messages_base: the
constructors, destructor, _Init, _Getcat (and msvcp60's argument-less
_Getcat), open/do_open, get/do_get, close/do_close, vtables, RTTI and ids.
As in the library this comes from, there are no message catalogs: open
gives -1, get returns the default string and close does nothing.
